  "schema:name": "PHWDocumentWithConsent",
  "dcterms:title": "IPS document that carries its consent directives",
  "dcterms:description": "An International Patient Summary document a Personal Health Wallet shares or an issuer issues, carrying the consent directives it is shared under, explicit or implied. Carrying them is optional (0..*); when they are carried, the Composition's Advance Directives section (LOINC 42348-3) lists them. The copy in the document is evidence for the receiver; the copy in the sharer's Consent Registry is the one enforced.",
